{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34363","headline":"奉和袭美病中庭际海石榴花盛发见寄次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美病中庭际海石榴花盛发见寄次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫府真人饷露囊，猗兰灯烛未荧煌。\n丹华乞曙先侵日，金焰欺寒却照霜。\n谁与佳名从海曲，秖应芳裔出河阳。\n那堪谢氏庭前见，一段清香染郄郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}